"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1397566565864286&title=%09%E2%80%9CThe+most+Newtown+thing+I%E2%80%99ve+ever+seen+is+people+helping+other+Newtowners.%E2%80%9D++That+spirit+is+at+the+center+of+this+conversation.+New+episode+of+Two+Guys+and+a+Pint+drops+today.+%5Bopen.spotify.com%2Fepisode%2F7r8DYqRzUQLxfbc5iAEe4A%3Fsi%3DIvjmF1ucSvmtK9mhANlCYA%26amp%3Bamp%3Bnd%3D1%26amp%3Bamp%3Bdlsi%3D65f61...%5DMichelle+Embree+Ku+talked+about+property+taxes%2C+education+funding%2C+I-84%2C+affordable+housing%2C+local+volunteers%E2%80%94and+why+listening+at+the+more+than+the+1%2C000+doors+she%E2%80%99s+knocked+on+this+year%E2%80%94is+important.+Her+reason+is+simple%3A+%E2%80%9CI+want+to+know+what%E2%80%99s+on+your+mind+so+I+can+be+a+better+representative.%E2%80%9D++And%2C+don%E2%80%99t+miss+Michelle%E2%80%99s+answer+to+this+important+question%3A+What+would+be+your+signature+dish+if+you+opened+a+Newtown+restaurant%3F%E2%80%A6Two+Guys+And+A+Pint+%23newtownct+%23podcast+%23cheesecake+%23volunteer+%23helpers+%09%09"
