"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1397714169182859&title=%09The+Difference+is+Clear+Day+2%3A+Taxes+%26amp%3Bamp%3B+BudgetsFamilies+are+feeling+the+squeeze%E2%80%94and+the+difference+is+clear.In+2025%2C+Mitch+Bolinsky+voted+%2ANO+on+the+state+budget+that+included+a+%24250+increase+to+the+Earned+Income+Tax+Credit+for+eligible+working+families+with+children.+Michelle+Embree+Ku+supports+putting+money+back+in+families%E2%80%99+pockets+while+working+to+lower+energy+and+health+insurance+costs%E2%80%94the+everyday+costs+that+make+it+harder+to+make+ends+meet+and+drive+pressure+on+local+property+taxes.That%E2%80%99s+the+difference%21+Newtown+deserves+a+representative+who+puts+working+families+first.%23TheDifferenceIsClear+%23NewtownCT+%23CTPolitics+%23WorkingFamilies+%23CostOfLiving+%23CTEITC+%23lookitup%2APA+25-168%2C+%C2%A7371+%7C+HB+7287%2C+House+Roll+Call+Vote+290%2A++%5Bwww.cga.ct.gov%2F2025%2FVOTE%2FH%2FPDF%2F2025HV-00290-R00HB07287-HV.PDF%5D%2AThe+law+added+%24250+to+Connecticut%E2%80%99s+EITC+for+qualifying+taxpayers+with+at+least+one+child%2C+beginning+with+tax+year+2025.%2A+%5Bcga.ct%5D%28www.cga.ct.gov%2F2025%2Frpt%2Fpdf%2F2025-R-0093.pdf%29+%09%09"
},
