"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1398785045742438&title=%09Real+solutions%2C+not+political+buzzwords.+Michelle+Embree+Ku+is+ready+to+fight+for%3ALower+energy+%26amp%3Bamp%3B+healthcare+costsFair+state+education+fundingReal+property+tax+relief+for+local+familiesLearn+more+and+join+the+campaign+at+the+link+in+bio%21+%F0%9F%94%97%23VoteNow+%23VoteBlue+%23VoteEarly+%23election+%23Connecticut+%23Newtown+%23HealthCare+%23education+%23taxes+%09%09"
},
{
"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1392828179671458&title=%09I%26%23039%3Bve+been+thinking+about+the+news+from+Cornell+this+week.+It+brings+back+memories+from+my+experience+as+an+undergraduate+at+Cornell+that+I+have+kept+to+myself+for+decades.When+I+was+at+the+university%2C+a+friend+went+to+a+fraternity+party.+The+next+morning%2C+I+learned+she%26%23039%3Bd+been+left+behind%2C+unconscious%2C+and+that+by+the+time+someone+found+her%2C+photos+had+been+taken+of+her+without+her+consent.+Someone+made+sure+those+photos+didn%26%23039%3Bt+spread.+But+no+one+ever+reported+what+happened.+I+think+she+believed%2C+like+so+many+young+women+did+then%2C+that+somehow+it+was+partly+her+fault+-+for+being+there%2C+for+drinking%2C+for+trusting+people+she+shouldn%26%23039%3Bt+have.That+was+more+than+30+years+ago%2C+but+it+has+always+disturbed+me+that+there+was+acceptance+by+me+and+her+friend+group+that+we+remain+silent.+There+was+an+unspoken+understanding+that+the+fear+of+the+accountability+she+might+face+and+embarrassment+were+good+enough+reasons+to+not+report+anything.++Although+a+lot+has+changed+in+attitudes+about+victim-blaming+in+30+years%2C+the+fear+of+getting+in+trouble+for+drinking+or+drug+use+hasn%26%23039%3Bt+gone+away+for+a+lot+of+young+people+today.Connecticut+has+a+law+that+passed+in+2021+that+protects+the+student+who+reports+a+sexual+assault+from+discipline+for+drug+or+alcohol+violations+tied+to+that+incident+%28my+opponent+was+absent+for+that+vote%29.+But+it%26%23039%3Bs+less+clear+that+the+same+protection+extends+to+a+friend+who+steps+in+to+help%2C+calls+for+help%2C+or+reports+on+someone+else%26%23039%3Bs+behalf.+That+ambiguity+should+be+clarified+so+that++nothing+deters+witnesses+and+bystanders+from+doing+the+right+thing.+No+student+calling+for+help+should+have+to+weigh+getting+someone+the+help+they+need+against+getting+in+trouble+themselves.+We+can+close+that+gap+by+clarifying+the+law+that+already+exists.I+am+aware+that+legislation+alone+won%26%23039%3Bt+fix+this.+Victim-blaming%2C+fraternity+culture%2C+entitlement%2C+privilege%2C+morality%2C+institutional+accountability+all+deserve+a+much+more+lengthy+discussion.+Laws+can+close+gaps.+Only+we+can+change+what+we+tolerate.%23DoTheRightThings+%23SpeakUp+%23dosomethingCredit%3A+AP+Photo%2FHeather+Ainsworth+%09%09"
},
{
"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1393772126243730&title=%09I%E2%80%99ve+worked+to+preserve+the+open+spaces+that+define+our+town%2C+protect+the+aquifer+our+community+depends+on%2C+and+push+for+thoughtful+development+that+doesn%E2%80%99t+sacrifice+the+natural+resources+we+all+share.+As+a+scientist+and+longtime+local+leader%2C+I+know+that+climate+change+isn%E2%80%99t+abstract%3A+stronger+storms%2C+flooding%2C+rising+energy+costs%2C+and+threats+to+our+water+affect+Newtown+families+now.In+Hartford%2C+I%E2%80%99ll+fight+for+clean+energy%2C+resilient+infrastructure%2C+clean+water%2C+responsible+growth%2C+and+the+open+space+that+makes+Newtown+home.+I%E2%80%99m+honored+to+have+CTLCV%E2%80%99s+support+%E2%80%94+and+I+hope+to+earn+yours+this+November.CTLCV+-+Connecticut+League+of+Conservation+Voters%23newtownct+%23Connecticut+%23conservation+%23aquifer+%09%09"
},
{
"text": "Share on LinkedIn (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F902281863260413_1397967425824200&title=%09Proud+to+receive+an+A+grade+from+CT+Against+Gun+Violence+for+standing+up+for+common-sense+gun+violence+prevention.This+recognition+reflects+a+clear+commitment%3A+keeping+families+safe%2C+supporting+responsible+gun-safety+policies%2C+and+treating+gun+violence+as+the+public-safety+crisis+it+is.This+work+can%E2%80%99t+wait%E2%80%94and+I%E2%80%99ll+keep+fighting+for+safer+schools%2C+safer+neighborhoods%2C+and+a+Connecticut+where+every+family+can+live+without+fear.%23election+%23newtownct+%23Connecticut+%23vote+%23safety+%09%09"
